*.local
scratch/
tmp/

# NOTE: .env IS committed on purpose. Every host port comes from it, so the
# stack does not start without it. The only credentials in it are lab/lab and
# admin/admin, which are already printed in README.md and docker-compose.yml.
# If you fork this for anything real, rotate them and gitignore this file.
